<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:modeler="http://camunda.org/schema/modeler/1.0" xmlns:camunda="http://camunda.org/schema/1.0/bpmn" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_masterRuleData" targetNamespace="http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn" exporter="bpmn-tool" exporterVersion="1.2.0" modeler:executionPlatform="Camunda Platform" modeler:executionPlatformVersion="7.15.0">
  <bpmn:process id="masterRuleData" name="업무기준 Data관리" isExecutable="true">
    <bpmn:documentation>masterRuleData — As-Is mui cmb/MasterRuleData (분석 §1 / §8) 의 To-Be BPMN.

★ 동적 테이블(TB_MCA_&lt;업무기준ID&gt;, DDL on-demand — Q-001b)/동적 컬럼(컬럼정의 기반) 화면.

사용자 결정 (2026-06-04~05):
  - Q-007 동적 SQL 안전화 — 테이블명 서버 재조립(pRuleId 형식검증) + 조건컬럼 컬럼정의 화이트리스트 + 연산자 화이트리스트 + 값 파라미터 바인딩
  - Q-008 긴급적용 As-Is 유지 — To-Be 는 안전화된 단일 native 경로로 수렴(분기 로그 보존)
  - Q-006 audit = McmAuditEntity 체계(C_*/U_*) native 세팅, 프로그램ID='masterRuleData'
  - Q-005 orphan SQL 2종(Insert/UpdateMasterRuleSpecDataList) 제거

4 action 매핑 (As-Is UserTask 2종 흡수):
  action=search       → searchTask (masterRuleDataService.search) — CTE+ROW_NUMBER 페이징 + 5조건 동적 WHERE(BR-015/Q-007), 응답 { ds_GetMasterRuleData, cnt, totalCount }
  action=lov          → lovTask (masterRuleDataService.lov) — 컬럼정의+PK판정(INFORMATION_SCHEMA — As-Is ALL_CONS_COLUMNS 변환), 응답 { ds_GetRuleColList, cnt }
  action=save         → saveTask (masterRuleDataService.save) — U/D/C 분기 + GetMaxRuleSeq 채번(BR-010) + RULE_SEQ WHERE(BR-011) + audit(BR-014) + 재조회 동봉 (As-Is save→Main조회)
  action=searchExport → exportTask (masterRuleDataService.searchExport) — 전건 ORDER BY RULE_SEQ, 응답 { ds_GetMasterRuleDataExport, cnt }</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:extensionElements>
      <camunda:properties>
        <camunda:property name="input" value="action" />
      </camunda:properties>
    </bpmn:extensionElements>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="start">
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_to_gw</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="actionGateway">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="input" value="action" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_to_gw</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_search</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_lov</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_save</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_export</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="searchTask" name="Main 조회 (동적 테이블 페이징)" camunda:class="masterRuleDataService">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="search" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mcm.cmb.masterRuleData.dto.MasterRuleDataSearchRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_search</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_search_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="endSearch">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_search_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="lovTask" name="lov목록 조회 (컬럼정의+PK판정)" camunda:class="masterRuleDataService">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="lov" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mcm.cmb.masterRuleData.dto.MasterRuleDataSearchRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_lov</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_lov_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="endLov">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_lov_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="saveTask" name="Main 저장 (U/D/C + 채번 + 재조회)" camunda:class="masterRuleDataService">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="save" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mcm.cmb.masterRuleData.dto.MasterRuleDataSearchRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_save</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_save_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="endSave">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_save_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="exportTask" name="Main 조회 엑셀 Export (전건)" camunda:class="masterRuleDataService">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <camunda:properties>
          <camunda:property name="method" value="searchExport" />
          <camunda:property name="output" value="result" />
          <camunda:property name="dto" value="com.dongkuk.dmes.mcm.cmb.masterRuleData.dto.MasterRuleDataSearchRequest" />
        </camunda:properties>
      </bpmn:extensionElements>
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_export</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_export_end</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="endExport">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_export_end</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_to_gw" sourceRef="start" targetRef="actionGateway" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_search" name="search" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="searchTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_search_end" sourceRef="searchTask" targetRef="endSearch" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_lov" name="lov" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="lovTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_lov_end" sourceRef="lovTask" targetRef="endLov" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_save" name="save" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="saveTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_save_end" sourceRef="saveTask" targetRef="endSave" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_export" name="searchExport" sourceRef="actionGateway" targetRef="exportTask" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_export_end" sourceRef="exportTask" targetRef="endExport" />
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="BPMNDiagram_1">
